# Accepted Trivy findings. Each line has a reason; see SECURITY_FINDINGS.md.

# DS-0026 No HEALTHCHECK: Cloud Run ignores Docker HEALTHCHECK; the service has a startup
# probe on /health in infra/app/main.tf instead.
DS-0026

# GCP-0066 Customer-managed encryption key (CMEK): data is public FPL statistics and a model;
# Google-managed encryption at rest applies. A KMS key adds cost and key management for no
# confidentiality gain here.
GCP-0066

# GCP-0077 Bucket access logging: needs a second log bucket (or paid Data Access audit logs);
# objects are non-sensitive and admin activity (IAM, bucket changes) is audited by default.
GCP-0077
